<title>POLAND: POLISH WKSM OPENS 70.3 PCT ABOVE ISSUE PRICE.</title>
<headline>POLISH WKSM OPENS 70.3 PCT ABOVE ISSUE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish granite and gravel quarrier Wroclawskie Kopalnie Surowcow Mineralnych SA (WKSM) started trade on the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse at 70 zlotys, 70.3 percent above its issue price.</p>
<p>In June the treasury ministry allotted 132,950 shares in the firm at 44.1 zlotys from a previous minimum price of 26 zlotys.</p>
<p>The firm sold 80,600 new shares to employees at the fixed price of 26 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
